    "text": "<p><span class=\"urw-egyptienne\"><span class=\"fontsize-1-5em\">Put saving to work in your OR with reprocessed HARMONIC Shears</span></span></p>\n<p>For over two decades, Stryker's Sustainability Solutions has been the global leader in the reprocessing of single-use surgical devices.<sup>3&nbsp;</sup>HARMONIC 700 Shears are the newest addition to our reprocessed HARMONIC portfolio. While the devices have evolved over time, our approach to quality remains the same.&nbsp;</p>\n",
